                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "This week is #SuicidePreventionWeek. I\u2019ve cosponsored two important resolutions: the Suicide Prevention Month Resolution, which recognizes suicide as a serious public health issue, and the 988 Awareness Day Resolution, which highlights the lifesaving work of the Suicide & Crisis Lifeline.\n\nIt\u2019s so important that we pay attention to our loved ones and stand ready to support those in need. Together, we can raise awareness, offer help, and save lives.",
