                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I voted \u2018NO\u2019 on the Republican budget plan because it threatens access to healthcare for millions. By cutting Medicaid and driving up costs, Trump and House Republicans have already put families, hospitals, and community health centers in crisis. Their plan is less about governing and more about forcing a shutdown and blaming Democrats.",
