                "text": "My mission has always been to protect and be the voice of my constituents. With just hours left before the government shuts down, I am thinking about the 81,000 people in MS-02 who will see the cost of their health coverage go up if Republicans allow this crisis to happen. https://t.co/zqi0Rv4fS0",
