                "text": "Republicans had a chance to do their jobs today. Instead, they left after only two minutes.\n\nDemocrats stood ready to act to keep the government open, protect children\u2019s health care, and stop rising costs. \n\nA shutdown isn\u2019t by accident. It\u2019s by Republican design.",
